{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reconcile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"with","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"remote","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deleting","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deletedIDs","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"preserving","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"remote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The rows read from storage for the IDs in question. Rows for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"IDs the caller didn’t ask about are simply not here, and their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"absence means nothing.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"deletedIDs","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"IDs storage reports as deleted elsewhere. Removed with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same origin a full reconcile uses, so no deletion is recorded and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"none is echoed back to the store it came from. An ID that ","type":"text"},{"code":"remote","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"still holds is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" removed however it is named here: a live row","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is positive evidence, and a tombstone can be stale.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"preserving","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"IDs the caller knows carry unflushed local intent, exactly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as in the full reconcile. ","type":"text"},{"code":"remote","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has no authority over them, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"neither does ","type":"text"},{"code":"deletedIDs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". This store’s own un-drained ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"folded in automatically.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The counterpart to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"partial read — a refresh of the rows a sync tick reported as changed,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than of the whole table. Absorbing rows works identically; what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changes is where deletions come from.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A partial snapshot ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"cannot","type":"text"}]},{"text":" infer deletion from absence. An ID missing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from it was not deleted, it was not asked for, and treating the two alike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"would empty the store on the first partial merge. So removal is driven","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entirely by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deletedIDs"},{"text":", which the caller must have positive evidence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for — a history tombstone, not an empty result.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Does ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"text":" record changes — this is a hydration operation, for the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reason the full reconcile isn’t one.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","text":"EntityStore"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deleting"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV9reconcile4with8deleting10preservingyACyxG_Shy1